{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QDWgHld89c1793261379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超下午公開宏福苑大火獨立委員會報告，及交代跟進工作。勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡表示，獨立委員會運作期間，勞工處竭盡所能提供資料。針對吸煙而引起的地盤火警，勞工處已經修訂法例，從今年7月開始，全面禁止地盤內吸煙，委員會也建議促使承建商承擔起法定責任，勞工處已經落實。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203516-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E5%9C%B0%E7%9B%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E7%A6%81%E7%85%99%E8%A6%8F%E7%AF%84%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA%E8%87%A8%E6%99%82%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑報告‧全面改革｜地盤全面禁煙　規範高風險臨時物料｜一文看清</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:28.483235+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.784345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:26.956133+00:00","content_hash":"f93e796a90469c9bb05b1e7a25b291ec04ad62fdb088f87b0d5636a9110620da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:28.483235+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}